      "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519244703995-f4e0f30006d5?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&ixid=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&auto=format&fit=facearea&facepad=2&w=256&h=256&q=80",
    role: "Co-Founder / CTO",
  },
  {
    time: "Mar 16, 2020",
    title: "How to use search engine optimization to drive sales",
    description:
      "Optio cum necessitatibus dolor voluptatum provident commodi et. Quiaperiam fugiat nemo cumque.",
    author: "Lindsay Walton",
    author_avt:
      "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517841905240-472988babdf9?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&ixid=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&auto=format&fit=facearea&facepad=2&w=256&h=256&q=80",
    role: "Front-end Developer",
  },
  {
    time: "Feb 12, 2020",
    title: "Improve your customer experience",
    description:
      "Cupiditate maiores ullam eveniet adipisci in doloribus nulla minus. Voluptas iusto libero adipisci rem et corporis. Nostrud sint anim suntaliqua. Nulla eu labore irure incididunt velit cillum quis magna dolore.",
